<!--
    kuna-dwarf-nocall: a DWARF subprogram marked DW_CC_nocall loses the
    parameters that carry no location.

    Fixture decompiler/crates/kuna-analysis/tests/fixtures/dwarfnocall_x86_64
    (source and build line in dwarfnocall_x86_64.c). Clang's dead-argument
    elimination removed `unused` from work(int *p, int unused, int k) and the
    constant `b` from pick(int a, int b), marked both DW_CC_nocall, and kept
    every source parameter in the DWARF. Locking the source list put the real
    second argument under the name `unused` and made each caller pass an
    undefined extra argument.

    Stage: P1 program prep, the DWARF commit (strict fix, no option).
-->
